  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Offer four lowercase choices and exactly one right answer. Never change that count.",
      "Mark the missing slot with ... . Do not use a blank line, underscore, or the word blank.",
      "Never put next and then in the same choice list. They both fit many middle slots.",
      "Never write two choices that both fit the gap. After and then must not both work.",
      "Tier 1 distractors are linking words that do not show time: because, if, but, and.",
      "Tier 2 adds one wrong time-order word plus linking-word distractors.",
      "Tier 3 uses near-miss time words: before vs after, later vs earlier, yesterday vs tomorrow or soon.",
      "Stems stay in kid world: school, home, food, pets, play, family, weather. No brands.",
      "Use only the roots wordlist, allowed_extra_words, and <NAME>. No real names.",
      "Do not name or describe a picture in the stem. Lemma notes only."
    ]
  },
